  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3971,
      "text": "Sād[1]. By the Qur’an, full of reminder[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3972,
      "text": "yet those who disbelieve are in arrogance and dissension.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3973,
      "text": "How many generations have We destroyed before them, and they cried out when it was too late for deliverance.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3974,
      "text": "They wonder that a warner has come to them from among themselves[3], and the disbelievers say, “This is a magician and a liar!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3975,
      "text": "Has he made all gods into one God? Indeed, this is something strange!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3976,
      "text": "The leaders among them departed, saying, “Carry on as you are, and stay faithful to your gods. Indeed, there is a motive behind it[4].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3977,
      "text": "We have not heard of this in the last religion[5]. This is nothing but a fabrication.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3978,
      "text": "Has the Reminder been sent down to him from among us?” Rather, they are in doubt about My Reminder[6], for they have not yet tasted My punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3979,
      "text": "Or do they possess the treasuries of the mercy of your Lord, the All-Mighty, the Bestower?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3980,
      "text": "Or do they have the dominion of the heavens and earth and all that is between them? Then let them ascend by any means[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3981,
      "text": "This is only a small army[8] among several armies[9] that will soon be defeated.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3982,
      "text": "The people of Noah rejected [their messengers] before them, as did ‘Aad and Pharaoh, the owner of stakes[10];",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3983,
      "text": "and Thamūd and the people of Lot, and the dwellers of the Forest – such were the [denier] parties.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3984,
      "text": "Each of them rejected their messenger, therefore My punishment became inevitable.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 391,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3985,
      "text": "They are only waiting for a single Blast that cannot be stopped[11].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 392,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3986,
      "text": "They say, “Our Lord, hasten for us our share [of punishment] before the Day of Reckoning.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 38,
        "name": "سُورَةُ صٓ",
        "englishName": "Saad",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Saad",
        "numberOfAyahs": 88,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 453,
      "ruku": 392,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
